msgstr "git, wget, curl, cloud-init, cloud-utils-growpart und open-vm-tools installieren: ``yum -y install git wget curl cloud-init cloud-utils-growpart open-vm-tools``"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/vmware_templates.rst:123
